// unregistered gpumin.shared_* ops carry a compile-time i32 index attribute.
// The K loop is still unrolled, but each iteration now reads its column and
// row through gpumin.shared_col/shared_row instead of global memory.  The
// chapter-34 gate parses this with --allow-unregistered-dialect and
// canonicalises both sides before diffing.
